=== volume ls :: $ ployz volume ls
VOLUME	STORAGE	SHARED WRITES	MOUNTS	DEPLOYED	NEXT DEPLOY
cache	Managed volume (1 GB limit)	off	api:/cache	no	create
data	Docker volume (no size limit)	off	api:/data	no	create

